        ->  Index Scan using a8_nt2_pkey on a8_nt2 nt2
              Index Cond: (id = nt3.nt2_id)
  ->  Index Only Scan using a8_nt1_pkey on a8_nt1 nt1
        Index Cond: (id = nt2.nt1_id)
        Filter: (nt2.b1 AND (id IS NOT NULL))
